flowchart TB
  subgraph HOST[Trusted host: ingestion completes before Input]
    direction TB
    A[Ingestion APIs<br/>URL capture · file or folder<br/>Async large-file upload<br/>Transport not specified] --> B[Store all originals<br/>Wait for completion<br/>Choose one processor]
    B --> I[Input: itemId + source + originals array<br/>Each original: filename / relativePath<br/>+ stored artifact details]
  end
  subgraph PLUGIN[Untrusted processor]
    direction LR
    C[Process collection<br/>Scoped read · write · transcribe] --> D[Return manifest<br/>Artifact references + metadata]
  end
  I --> C
  subgraph SAVE[Trusted host owns publication]
    direction LR
    E{Validate result} -->|valid| F[Save one publication]
    E -->|invalid / failed| X[No published result]
  end
  D --> E
  F --> G[Search + readable fallback<br/>Optional isolated viewer]
